{"id":"en_the-silver-collar","title":"The Silver Collar","titleEn":"The Silver Collar","description":"Sold by her father to settle his debts, Evelyn finds refuge with a man whose reputation is as dangerous as his world. He turns out to be Adrian, the godfather of her former lover and the reigning mafia king of the city. Held inside his villa, she plays the deadly rivalry around her to her own advantage and breaks free. But her escape brings a fresh revelation: the death of her mother conceals a secret darker than anything she has faced. Those who want to follow how this story unfolds can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-silver-collar/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-silver-collar/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contract Lovers","Hate to Love","Plot Twist","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuf6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-silver-collar_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuf6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-silver-collar_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuf6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-silver-collar_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuf6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-silver-collar_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuf6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-silver-collar_5",